Firstly, for any $k \in \mathbb{Z}$, we define the following two energy functionals:
\begin{equation}\label{2.26}
	\bar{\mathfrak{E}_{\omega}}:={\rm e}^{2\delta_0\kappa t}\mathcal{E}_{\omega,0}+\mathcal{E}_{\omega,\neq}+\frac14\int_0^t({\rm e}^{2\delta_0\kappa \tau}\mathcal{D}_{\omega,0}+\mathcal{D}_{\omega,\neq})(\tau){\rm d}\tau,
